# Implementation Plan: ABDM HIU Integration (Milestones M1 & M3)

Build the complete ABDM (Ayushman Bharat Digital Mission) HIU integration in `com.medisense.abdm` for ABHA verification (M1) and HIU consent & health record pull (M3) against the ABDM Sandbox environment.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **ABDM Sandbox Integration Architecture**:
> - **ABDMAuthService**: Authenticates with `POST https://dev.abdm.gov.in/gateway/v0.5/sessions`, caches 30-min access tokens in Redis (TTL = 25 mins), with in-memory fallback if Redis is unreachable.
> - **ConsentRequestService**: Initiates HIU consent requests (`POST /v0.5/consent-requests/init`) with `CAREMGT` purpose, specified date range, and `hiTypes` (`DiagnosticReport`, `Observation`, `MedicationRequest`).
> - **JWTSigningInterceptor**: Spring `ClientHttpRequestInterceptor` that signs outgoing gateway requests using RS256 JWT with private key from configuration.
> - **ABDMCallbackController**: Asynchronous `@RestController` processing gateway callbacks at `/abdm/callback/consent/notify` and `/abdm/callback/health-info`, returning HTTP 202 Accepted immediately.
> - **FhirBundleParser**: Uses HAPI FHIR R4 (`FhirContext.forR4()`) to extract `Observation`, `DiagnosticReport`, and `MedicationRequest` resources into canonical `LabReportValue` and `Prescription` schemas.
> - **Database Migration**: Flyway script `V4__add_consent_requests_table.sql` for tracking consent requests and session mappings.

